<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus doctors on strike over pay, pensions.</title>
<headline>Cyprus doctors on strike over pay, pensions.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Government doctors in Cyprus went on a 24-hour strike on Thursday demanding improved pay and pensions, their union said.</p>
<p>About 450 doctors in the civil service observed the strike, which affected all government-run hospitals and outpatient departments. Reduced staffs were on call to deal with emergencies.</p>
</text>
